      "content": "but you dont get it. reframing it doesnt change the numbers. therapy isnt going to pay the rent or magically erase the debt. i just lie awake thinking about how much lighter their lives would be if they didn't have to worry about me. if i just... disappeared, that's one less mouth to feed and one less person to stress over. it almost seems like the only way to actually be \"selfless\" and stop dragging them down is to just stop being a part of the equation entirely. wouldn't that be more logical than just talking about feelings?\n Balance the idea equation. If just make it sound stop.  greco-roman? no. just say it",
